{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:45:53.573Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/firewall/nat **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/firewall/nat \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/firewall/raw **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/firewall/raw \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/nd/prefix **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/nd/prefix \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/nd/prefix/default **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ipv6/nd/prefix/default \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/nd/proxy **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/nd/proxy \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/nd/settings **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ipv6/nd/settings \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000An IPv6 Neighbor Discovery Proxy allows a router or host to respond to Neighbor Discovery([RFC 4861](LINK)) messages on behalf of another node. This enables communication across different network segments as if they were on the same link. In RouterOS, the proxy can be enabled for a single IPv6 address and works per interface.":"IPv6 邻居发现代理允许路由器或主机代表其他节点响应邻居发现（[RFC 4861](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4861)）消息。这使不同网段之间的通信如同位于同一链路上。在 RouterOS 中，可以为单个 IPv6 地址启用代理，并按接口工作。","docs-7.24\u0000Prefix information sent in router advertisement(RA) messages used for stateless address autoconfiguration([RFC 4862](LINK)). By default, autoconfiguration applies only to hosts and not routers.":"在路由器通告（RA）消息中发送的前缀信息，用于无状态地址自动配置（[RFC 4862](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4862)）。默认情况下，自动配置仅应用于主机，不应用于路由器。","docs-7.24\u0000The IPv6 ND menu has a sub-menu \"Settings\" which allows changing global neighbor discovery settings.":"IPv6 ND 菜单包含子菜单“Settings”，可用于修改全局邻居发现设置。"}}
